    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A volume of 1 cc of milk within a 1 litre can be considered still milk as a whole. If you scale down to a cluster of molecules, than the milk cannot be considered a fluid no more (and then no more a milk)."
