        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A decay is a fundamental process occurring to one particle that is expressed as a complete bipartite directed graph K(1,n) with n>1, being n the number of outgoing particles."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The class of fundamental systems where a particle generates two or more other particles."
      }
