        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Relates a material to the specific electrode role (positive or negative) it plays. Range tightened (v0.3.0) to the union of the two electrode-role classes so it can no longer point at ElectrolyteRoleIndividual/SeparatorRoleIndividual, which the property's name never intended. usesMaterial, its inverse, is left general over all four BatteryRole subclasses."
      }
