      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The lambert (symbol L, la or Lb) is a non-SI unit of luminance. A related unit of luminance, the foot-lambert, is used in the lighting, cinema and flight simulation industries. The SI unit is the candela per square metre (cd/m²).\n\n-- QUDT"
      }
