        "@value": "φ is a class of the theory"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "We usa a predicate template notation as DP<φ>(x,y) to specify subclasses of DP(x,y) for the class φ, meaning that DP<φ>(x, y) ≡ PP(x, y) ∧ (φ(x) ↔ ¬φ(y))"
      }
