        "@value": "\"Stathenry\" (statH) is a unit in the category of Electric inductance. It is also known as stathenries. This unit is commonly used in the cgs unit system. Stathenry (statH) has a dimension of ML²T⁻²I⁻² where M is mass, L is length, T is time, and I is electric current. It can be converted to the corresponding standard SI unit H by multiplying its value by a factor of 8.987552 × 10¹¹ .\n\n-- QUDT"
