      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Deals with entities that have a undefined shape. Undefined means that the actual shape of the entity that is produced is not relevant for the definition of the process.\nIn fact, everything has a shape, but in process engineering this is not relevant.\n\ne.g. the fact that steel comes in sheets is not relevant for the definition of steel material generated in a steel-making process."
      }
    ],
