      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A non-SI coherent can be expressed in terms of its corresponding SI coherent unit, as\n\n    nonsi_coherent_unit = si_coherent_unit * multiplier + offset\n\nwhere `multiplier` and `offset` are specified via the 'hasConversionMultiplier' and 'hasConversionOffset' data properties, respectively."
      }
