  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_479db031_b344_4488_9efa_4bc12c6c1765",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "A solid is defined as a portion of matter that is in a condensed state characterised by resistance to deformation and volume changes."
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "In physics, a rigid body (also known as a rigid object[2]) is a solid body in which deformation is zero or so small it can be neglected. The distance between any two given points on a rigid body remains constant in time regardless of external forces or moments exerted on it. A rigid body is usually considered as a continuous distribution of mass."
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "They are not powders or threads"
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "The raw material or partially finished piece that is shaped by performing various operations."
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "fili e polveri non sono compresi"
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "It has a shape, so we conclude that it is solid"
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "In manufacturing, a workpiece is a single, delimited part of largely solid material that is processed in some form (e.g. stone )."
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "a physical artifact, real or virtual, intended for subsequent transformation within some manufacturing operation"
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "Seems to have to be processed through mechanical deformation. So it takes part of a manufacturing process. It is a Manufactured Product and it can be a Commercial Product"
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "A WorkPiece is physical artifact, that has a proper shape and occupyes a proper volume intended for subsequent transformation. It is a condensed state, so it is a compact body that is processed or  has to be processed."
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "powder is not workpiece because it has the shape of the recipient containing them"
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "it seems to be solid, so it has a proper shape"
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "it seems to be an intermediate product, that has to reach the final shape."
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "Object that is processed with a machine"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/emmo/disciplines/manufacturing#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "WorkPiece"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_ec7464a9_d99d_45f8_965b_4e9230ea8356"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "Werkstück"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "WorkPiece"
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "A WorkPiece is physical artifact, that has a proper shape and occupyes a proper volume intended for subsequent transformation. It is a condensed state, so it is a compact body that is processed or  has to be processed."
      }
    ]
  },
